eycomb Pads</td>\n                            <td class=\"p-6 text-[10px]\">High efficiency evaporation filter</td>\n                            <td class=\"p-6 highlight-orange\">₹950</td>\n                            <td class=\"p-6\"><a href=\"/honeycomb-pad\" class=\"text-blue-600 font-bold hover:underline uppercase text-[10px]\">Buy Part</a></td>\n                        </tr>\n                    </tbody>\n                </table>\n            </div>\n            <p class=\"text-center text-gray-500 mt-6 text-xs italic\">All prices for air cooler repair services godhra are inclusive of standard installation.</p>\n        </section>\n\n        <!-- PROS AND CONS SECTION -->\n        <section class=\"grid lg:grid-cols-2 gap-12\">\n            <div class=\"bg-emerald-50 p-10 rounded-3xl border-t-8 border-emerald-500 shadow-lg\">\n                <h3 class=\"text-2xl font-black text-emerald-900 mb-6 uppercase\">Benefits of Professional Service</h3>\n                <ul class=\"space-y-4 text-[10px] font-black uppercase text-emerald-800 tracking-tighter\">\n                    <li class=\"flex gap-2\"><span class=\"text-emerald-500\">✔</span> Increases life of <span class=\"highlight-orange\">copper motors</span> significantly.</li>\n                    <li class=\"flex gap-2\"><span class=\"text-emerald-500\">✔</span> Ensures <span class=\"highlight-gold\">100% germ-free air</span> via deep tank cleaning.</li>\n                    <li class=\"flex gap-2\"><span class=\"text-emerald-500\">✔</span> Prevents high electricity bills from jammed bearings.</li>\n                    <li class=\"flex gap-2\"><span class=\"text-emerald-500\">✔</span> Restores original airflow throw for <span class=\"highlight-orange\">desert coolers</span>.</li>\n                </ul>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"bg-rose-50 p-10 rounded-3xl border-t-8 border-rose-500 shadow-lg text-rose-900\">\n                <h3 class=\"text-2xl font-black mb-6 uppercase\">Risks of Neglecting Repair</h3>\n                <ul class=\"space-y-4 text-[10px] font-black uppercase tracking-tighter\">\n                    <li class=\"flex gap-2\"><span class=\"text-rose-500\">✘</span> Total motor burnout due to <span class=\"highlight-orange\">dry running pumps</span>.</li>\n                    <li class=\"flex gap-2\"><span class=\"text-rose-500\">✘</span> Respiratory issues from <span class=\"highlight-gold\">mold-infested filters</span>.</li>\n                    <li class=\"flex gap-2\"><span class=\"text-rose-500\">✘</span> Dangerous short circuits in old wiring systems.</li>\n                </ul>\n            </div>\n        </section>\n\n        <!-- INDUSTRIAL AREAS SECTION (GODHRA / PANCHMAHAL) -->\n        <section id=\"industrial-gidc\">\n            <h2 class=\"text-3xl font-black text-blue-900 uppercase mb-8 text-center\">GIDC and Industrial air cooler repair services godhra</h2>\n            \n            <p class=\"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed text-sm lg:text-base text-center max-w-4xl mx-auto mb-10\">\n                The Panchmahal district is home to major industrial clusters that require massive cooling capacities. Our industrial division specializes in maintaining heavy-duty systems in the region&#8217;s largest estates. We provide <span class=\"highlight-orange\">air cooler repair services godhra</span> for chemical, engineering, and manufacturing factories.\n            </p>\n\n            <div class=\"grid grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-4 lg:grid-cols-5 gap-4 text-[10px] font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-gray-500 text-center\">\n                <span class=\"bg-white p-3 rounded shadow hover:border-orange-500 border transition\">Godhra GIDC Estate</span>\n                <span class=\"bg-white p-3 rounded shadow hover:border-orange-500 border transition\">Halol GIDC Phase 1-4</span>\n                <span class=\"bg-white p-3 rounded shadow hover:border-orange-500 border transition\">Kalol GIDC Cluster</span>\n                <spa